## Appendix: Popular National Parks and their codes

| Park Name | Park Code |
|-----------|-----------|
| Yosemite | yose |
| Grand Canyon | grca |
| Yellowstone | yell |
| Zion | zion |
| Great Smoky Mountains | grsm |
| Acadia | acad |
| Olympic | olym |
| Rocky Mountain | romo |
| Joshua Tree | jotr |
| Sequoia & Kings Canyon | seki |

For a complete list, visit the [NPS website](https://www.nps.gov/findapark/index.htm).

